---
layout: base
title: Home
permalink: /
description: Mobius is a Tampa Bay tech partner for local businesses. Websites, booking, Google and tech help for a fixed price. Start with a free tech checkup.
---

<!-- 1. Hero -->
<section class="section bg-white">
  <div class="wrap-narrow text-center">
    <p class="eyebrow mb-6">Serving local businesses in {{ site.region }}</p>
    <h1 class="h-display mb-6">
      Your website, booking and Google presence,
      <span class="text-brand-gradient">handled by one local team.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl">
      Mobius is a {{ site.region }} tech partner for local businesses. We fix and run the tech, and you pay a fixed price that is agreed in writing first. The first step is a free tech checkup.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
      <a href="{{ site.cta.href }}" class="btn-primary">{{ site.cta.label }}</a>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="btn-secondary">See packages and prices</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-gray-600">Free. 20 minutes. {{ site.callHours }}.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 2. Problems -->
<section class="section bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="problems-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="problems-heading" class="h-section mb-3 text-center">Sound familiar?</h2>
    <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">These are the everyday tech problems we hear from local business owners.</p>
    <ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <li class="card">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">📱</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Your website looks broken on phones</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Text is tiny, buttons are hard to tap and pages load slowly. Visitors give up and call someone else.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">⏱️</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Inquiries sit for hours</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Someone fills out your form while you are busy with customers, and nobody answers until later.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🚫</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">No-shows leave gaps in your day</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">An empty slot is lost money, and there is no system to remind people or fill it.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">📍</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Google shows the wrong hours</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Customers arrive at a closed door or call a number that no longer works.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🧩</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Five vendors, nobody accountable</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">When something breaks, each company points at another one and you are left in the middle.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">♿</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Your booking tool doesn't work for everyone</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Some customers can't use it with a keyboard or a screen reader, so they never finish booking.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. What we handle -->
<section class="section bg-white" aria-labelledby="services-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="services-heading" class="h-section mb-3 text-center">What we handle</h2>
    <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">One team for the tech your business runs on.</p>
    <ul class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
      {% for service in services %}
      <li class="card-muted flex flex-col">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">{{ service.icon }}</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">{{ service.name }}</h3>
        <p class="mb-4 flex-1 text-gray-600">{{ service.summary }}</p>
        <p><a href="/services/#{{ service.id }}" class="link font-semibold">More about {{ service.name }}</a></p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4. Packages preview -->
<section class="section bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="packages-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="packages-heading" class="h-section mb-3 text-center">Fixed-price packages</h2>
    <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">You see the price before any work starts. Here are three ways to begin.</p>
    <ul class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
      {% for package in packages.all %}
      {% if package.featured or package.id == "checkup" %}
      <li class="card flex flex-col">
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-gray-900">{{ package.name }}</h3>
        <p class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900">{{ package.price }}</p>
        <p class="mb-4 text-sm text-gray-600">{{ package.priceNote }}</p>
        <p class="mb-6 flex-1 text-gray-700">{{ package.tagline }}</p>
        <p><a href="{{ package.cta.href }}" class="btn-secondary w-full">{{ package.cta.label }}</a></p>
      </li>
      {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-8 text-center"><a href="/pricing/" class="link font-semibold">See every package and what each one includes</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5. How it works -->
<section class="section bg-white" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="how-heading" class="h-section mb-10 text-center">How it works</h2>
    <ol class="grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <li>
        <span class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 text-xl font-bold text-white" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900"><span class="sr-only">Step 1: </span>Free checkup</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">A 20-minute call plus a written scan of your website, booking flow and Google profile. You get a plain-English list of the top fixes.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 text-xl font-bold text-white" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900"><span class="sr-only">Step 2: </span>Fixed-price plan in writing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">We tell you what we would do and what it costs. Fees from other software companies are quoted up front too.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 text-xl font-bold text-white" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900"><span class="sr-only">Step 3: </span>We build it</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">We do the work and keep you posted. You don't need to learn new tools or sit through a technical meeting.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-600 to-purple-600 text-xl font-bold text-white" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900"><span class="sr-only">Step 4: </span>We stay on as your tech partner</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">If you want ongoing help, a monthly plan covers checkups, changes and questions. It is month-to-month, with no long-term contract.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 6. Who we serve -->
<section class="section bg-gray-50" aria-labelledby="serve-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="serve-heading" class="h-section mb-3 text-center">Who we serve</h2>
    <p class="lede mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center">We work with local businesses across {{ site.areas | join(", ") }} and the rest of {{ site.region }}. Here are the types we see most.</p>
    <ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      {% for audience in audiences %}
      <li>
        <a href="/industries/#{{ audience.id }}" class="card flex h-full items-center gap-3 p-4 font-semibold text-gray-900 hover:border-indigo-400 md:p-4">
          <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">{{ audience.icon }}</span>
          <span>{{ audience.name }}</span>
        </a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p class="mt-8 text-center"><a href="/industries/" class="link font-semibold">See how we help each type of business</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7. Why a local partner -->
<section class="section bg-white" aria-labelledby="why-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="why-heading" class="h-section mb-10 text-center">Why a local partner</h2>
    <ul class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <li class="card-muted">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🤝</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">You talk to the person doing the work</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">No account managers or ticket queues. You explain the problem once, to someone who can fix it.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card-muted">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">📝</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Fixed prices, in writing</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">Every project gets a price in writing before work starts, so there are no surprise invoices.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card-muted">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">🌙</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Evening and weekend calls</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">You are busy running a business all day. We can talk when you have time, and we reply within {{ site.responseTime }}.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="card-muted">
        <span class="mb-3 block text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">💬</span>
        <h3 class="mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Plain English</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600">We explain what is wrong, what it will take to fix, and what it costs, without jargon.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 8. Closing band -->
<section class="section band-dark on-dark text-center">
  <div class="wrap-narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl">Start with a free tech checkup</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mb-8 max-w-xl text-lg text-indigo-100">
      You get a 20-minute call and a written report of your top fixes, ranked. There is nothing to buy. We reply within {{ site.responseTime }}.
    </p>
    <a href="{{ site.cta.href }}" class="btn-light">{{ site.cta.label }}</a>
    <p class="mt-6 text-indigo-100">Not ready for a call? <a href="/contact/" class="font-semibold text-white underline underline-offset-2">Send us a message instead</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>
